Adjusted the built-in armor protection zones for the following armor vests and armored rigs:
- ECLiPSE RBAV-AF plate carrier – removed the groin protection;
- Crye Precision AVS, Stich Profi Plate Carrier V2 – moved the stomach protection to groin protection, removed the lower back protection.

Reduced the penalties and increased the spawn chance for the following heavy armor vests:
- 6B43 Zabralo-Sh body armor;
