Added new barters at Ragman Loyalty Level 4:
- FORT Redut-M body armor (Without plates);
- FORT Redut-T5 body armor (Without plates);
- IOTV Gen4 body armor (Full Protection Kit) (Without plates).

Removed outdated trade offers at Mechanic Loyalty Level 1, previously unlocked after completing the task "Failed Setup":
- GP-25 Kostyor 40mm underbarrel grenade launcher;
- M203 40mm underbarrel grenade launcher;
- 40x46mm M386 (HE) grenade;
