Please note that some fixes may contain story spoilers.

- Fixed the issues with culling, shadows, textures, and location geometry;
- Fixed an issue where water bodies could disappear for some players at certain graphics settings;
- Fixed an issue where healing continued after cancellation when searching a backpack looted from another player;
- Fixed an issue where players in PvE Zone did not receive achievements after completing all conditions. Missing achievements will be granted;
- Fixed the incorrect damage registration after fixing a weapon malfunction in certain cases;
- Fixed the cause of BTR Driver task progression resetting in certain cases;
- Removed the ability to list incomplete ammo stacks on the Flea Market;
- Fixed the inability to pay for vehicle extracts when currency was split across multiple stacks;
