- Fixed an issue preventing item filter selection at traders;
- Fixed the incorrect purchase price of the BNTI Kirasa-N armor (Green) at trader Ref;
- Fixed the inability to transfer items to traders immediately after receiving them via in-game messages;
- Fixed the ammo display in the Scav Case rewards;
- Fixed the missing rewards from the Cultist Circle in certain cases;
- Fixed the incorrect stash size display for The Unheard Edition in the Hideout;
- Fixed the fuel display in the Generator zone after visiting another player’s Hideout;
- Fixed the client freezes when viewing certain player profiles;
- Fixed an issue where some PMC bots would not attack player Scavs in PvE Zone;
